[{"format":20190412,"id":1756000000000,"revision":3,"title":"Nessuvia","lists":[{"title":"Ideas","notes":[{"text":"Multiplayer session polish\nResume/create a session from an existing chat with characters listed for guests. Guest end-of-session screen with transcript download. Guests can skip their own turn. Per-speaker character/palette colors and avatar cropping carried into a session.","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"Message provenance\nMark messages human vs LLM and owner vs guest, with an icon by guest names in the saved chat.","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"Alternate chat presentations\nPhone texting UI and a visual-novel sprite/dialogue mode.","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"Authoring extras\nCtrl-I / Ctrl-B asterisk markup on a selection, per-dropdown hide for tags, NovelAI-style scenario entities, chat stats (opens, multiplayer uses, message count).","raw":false,"min":false}]},{"title":"In Consideration","notes":[]},{"title":"Rejected","notes":[]},{"title":"Approved","notes":[{"text":"Lorebooks off the character record\nMake WorldInfoEntry.characterId nullable, add a chat-level book picker, import bare SillyTavern world-info JSON. Matching, depth, budget and order already work.","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"World info keys match on word boundaries\nworldInfo.ts mentions() is a substring test: a key of \"BA\" fires inside \"abandon\".","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"/continue slash command\nA reply cut off at max_tokens can only be rerolled, not resumed.","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"Chat export\nTranscript download as plaintext, markdown and JSON. Host side first; the guest end-of-session screen builds on this.","raw":false,"min":false}]},{"title":"In Progress","notes":[{"text":"Bucket sync (BYO-S3)\nSigV4 push/pull works; module commented out in main.tsx, BYO-S3 decision unmade.","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"Slop sieve / prose linter\nPlan in src/resources/slop-sieve-plan.md; core/hammer built, no UI module registered yet.","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"Body map plugin buildout\nRegistered as a plugin, still being filled in.","raw":false,"min":false}]},{"title":"Done","notes":[{"text":"Chat and Write\nCharacter chat (roster, swipes, bookmarks, tags, slash commands, rewrite box) and long-form Write mode (chapters, beats, Plot Layout, prose markup, export, single left rail).","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"Characters and personas\nCharacter list and editor, split-out profile, character card v2 PNG round-trip, card import from URL, user personas with the chat PersonaSwitcher.","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"Prompt pipeline\nbuildPrompt, buildStoryPrompt, swapTokens, worldInfo, conditions, chapterGuide, rewrite, plus token budgeting and history trimming.","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"Connectors and params\nopenaiCompatible SSE streaming, request builder, model list, snapshot, the dummy local connector, and the params-as-data sampler library with ParamBuilder.","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"Multiplayer\nGuests join a host chat from a link. Centrifugo relay behind one channel interface, protocol with version rejection and 240 KB cap, turn order, narrator, roster avatars, join route outside the app shell.","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"Appearance\nPalettes with generator and import, skins, webfonts, background image and CSS, runtime CSS var overwrite, sanitizeHtml allowlist and scopeCss @scope wrapping.","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"Storage and backup\ndb.version(12) as the only Dexie touchpoint with markDirty on writes; backup.ts round-trips Dexie plus the three localStorage stores; stripApiKeys blanks secrets before export.","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"App shell\nModule registry the sidebar and router derive from, shared components and hooks, mobile layout pass with side drawer, splash animation, Ask scratchpad, Learn tab, body map plugin.","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"Settings module\nConnections, params, relay, grammar hammer (tagger to repair, with exclusions), tag rules, templates, misc.","raw":false,"min":false},{"text":"Ship path\nPWA install, Cloudflare Worker serving dist with dev and release configs, vendored Nullboard kanban syncing cards as JSON.","raw":false,"min":false}]}]}]